    ["45级护符词条"] = "Level 45 Charm Affix",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Medical Miracle】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Life</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>In the Saint Selena Cathedral square, a young man who keeps apologizing seems to have some trouble. Go and take a look. \n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After reaching <Assistant_Red>Acting Level 55</>, go to {Location:[廷根(844,818)]|-15677;-18167;-1398;2;5200002;0}the location to trigger the quest\n. <Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Soule, Invoice Receipt, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure Progress"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Medical Miracle】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Life</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>In the Saint Selena Cathedral square, a young man who keeps apologizing seems to have some trouble. Go and take a look. \n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After reaching <Assistant_Red>Acting Level 55</>, go to {Location:[Tingen(844,818)]|-15677;-18167;-1398;2;5200002;0}the location to trigger the quest\n. <Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Invoice Receipt, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【公证书】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>说明：</>攻击类型封印物\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>副本倾向封印物，施放普通技能和终极技能时会进行公证，成功后提升<Assistant_Red>公证层数/>，超过等级上限时转化为本次技能的伤害或治疗加成；公证失败时会降低该<Assistant_Red>公证层数</>，并使该技能本次造成的<Assistant_Red>伤害</>和<Assistant_Red>治疗</>效果降低。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>默认解锁封印物，无需额外获得。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Notarization Document】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Attack-type Sealed Artifact\n<Assistant_Title2>Details: </>A dungeon-oriented Sealed Artifact. Notarization occurs when casting basic and ultimate skills. Upon success, it increases <Assistant_Red>Notarization Stacks/>; if it exceeds the level cap, it converts into a damage or healing bonus for the current skill. If notarization fails, the <Assistant_Red>Notarization Stacks</> decrease, and the <Assistant_Red>Damage</> and <Assistant_Red>Healing</> effects of the skill are reduced.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Default unlocked Sealed Artifact, no additional acquisition required.",
    ["<CostRed>已过期</>"] = "<CostRed> has expired </>",
    ["<Highlight_L>%s</>已成为新队长"] = "<Highlight_L>%s</> has become the new captain.",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>《诡秘之主》公测已至，非凡世界的大门已向您敞开，欢迎踏上这片真实与隐秘交织的大地。</>\n\n<M_Default>为感谢您在【灰雾测试】期间的陪伴与信任，您曾留下的那一笔笔“投资”，如今穿梭灵界而来，化作更加丰富的返还奖励。</>请前往<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=2000067\">廷根·吉福特</>处领取您的充值返还奖励。\n\n愿这些回馈能让您在新世界的旅途玩得更加开心。"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>The public beta of \"Lord of Mysteries\" has arrived, and the door to the Extraordinary World has opened to you. Welcome to this land intertwined with reality and mystery. </>\n\n<M_Default>To thank you for your companionship and trust during the [Gray Fog Test], the \"investments\" you left behind have now traveled through the Spirit World and transformed into even richer return rewards. </>Please go to <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=2000067\">Tingen Gifford</> to claim your recharge return rewards. \n\nMay these returns make your journey in the new world even more enjoyable.",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>下次得小心说话了……"] = "<P_Heart> (Whispering) </> Need to be careful with my words next time...",
    ["<P_Heart>（感觉很宁静……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Feels very peaceful...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（看来施佩尔先生的灵体被困在了这个空间，所以现实世界的他才会疯疯癫癫的。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(It seems Mr. Speer's spirit body is trapped in this space, which is why he is acting crazy in the real world.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（还是及时止损吧……）</> "] = "<P_Heart> (Better cut my losses now...) </>",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>猎杀时刻活动时间</>\n<Highlight>每日19:00—20:00</>开放；每周六、周日额外开放<Highlight>14:00—15:00</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>王城区域限时事件</>\n猎杀时刻期间，可在王城中心【异变营地】限时召唤<Highlight>命运人偶</>，击败后可获得猩红遗物材料。\n每周五、周日晚的猎杀时刻开启<Highlight>10分钟后</>，即<Highlight>19:10</>，王城中心将刷新<Highlight>巨龙·投影</>。击退巨龙时，当前有效归属伤害最高的团队获得拍卖奖励。每次猎杀时刻活动中，每名玩家至多获得<Highlight>1次</>巨龙·投影的终末猎杀拍卖资格；已取得资格的玩家，本次活动内无法再次取得。\n除周五、周日晚场外，其他猎杀时刻开始<Highlight>10分钟后</>，王城中心将刷新<Highlight>王城守卫者</>。击败王城守卫者后，完成最后一击的团队成员共享对应奖励。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>段位胜点双倍收益</>\n猎杀时刻期间，击杀敌对玩家可掠夺<Highlight>双倍段位胜点</>；被击杀时，损失的段位胜点同样翻倍。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Hunting Time Event Hours </> \n <Highlight> Open daily from 19:00—20:00 </>; additional hours on Saturdays and Sundays from <Highlight> 14:00—15:00 </>. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Royal City Area Limited-Time Event </> \n During Hunting Time, you can summon a <Highlight> Fate Marionette </> for a limited time at the [Mutated Camp] in the center of the Royal City; defeating it yields Scarlet Relic materials. \n 10 minutes after <Highlight> the start of Hunting Time on Friday and Sunday nights </>, i.e., <Highlight> 19:10 </>, a <Highlight> Dragon - Projection </> will spawn in the center of the Royal City. When the dragon is repelled, the team with the highest effective attributed damage receives the auction rewards. In each Hunting Time event, each player can obtain at most <Highlight> 1 </> qualification for the Dragon - Projection Final Hunt auction; players who have already obtained the qualification cannot obtain it again during this event. \n Except for the Friday and Sunday night sessions, 10 minutes after <Highlight> other Hunting Time sessions begin </>, the <Highlight> Royal City Guardian </> will spawn in the center of the Royal City. After defeating the Royal City Guardian, team members who land the final blow share the corresponding rewards. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Double Rank Point Gains </> \n During Hunting Time, killing hostile players allows you to plunder <Highlight> double rank points </>; when killed, the rank points lost are also doubled.",
